WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.238 --> 00:00:02.183
- Do you like questioning
your intelligence?

00:00:02.183 --> 00:00:03.901
Then do I have the thing for you.

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:04.734
- Riddle.

00:00:09.443 --> 00:00:13.442
- Are you good at riddle
solving not drunk or at all?

00:00:13.442 --> 00:00:14.539
- Riddles.

00:00:14.539 --> 00:00:16.901
- I'm not, I can't really
think outside the box.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:17.993
- I hate solving riddles sober.

00:00:17.993 --> 00:00:19.107
- Me too.

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:22.427
- There's a box, I'm
over here for the riddle.

00:00:22.427 --> 00:00:23.535
- Dead center.

00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:25.085
(laughs)

00:00:25.085 --> 00:00:26.565
- Who likes riddles?

00:00:26.565 --> 00:00:27.565
- Dr. Seuss.

00:00:28.457 --> 00:00:29.723
- No he likes rhymes.

00:00:29.723 --> 00:00:30.738
- Bridge trolls?

00:00:30.738 --> 00:00:33.071
- Okay, fine, bridge trolls.

00:00:45.134 --> 00:00:46.206
- The sky?

00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:48.615
(laughing)

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:49.775
That's really dumb.

00:00:49.775 --> 00:00:50.608
- Do you know?

00:00:50.608 --> 00:00:51.482
- No I'm sad.

00:00:51.482 --> 00:00:52.538
- I already know what it is.

00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:54.024
- Infinity, right?

00:00:54.024 --> 00:00:56.026
- The universe, space, a circle?

00:00:56.026 --> 00:00:57.582
- The end of time and space is.

00:00:57.582 --> 00:00:59.915
- And surrounds every place.

00:01:03.606 --> 00:01:04.439
- A border.

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:05.272
- No.

00:01:05.272 --> 00:01:06.665
- 'Cause there is no end to time

00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:08.998
and space, so it's infinite.

00:01:10.324 --> 00:01:11.157
Why?

00:01:11.157 --> 00:01:12.852
Because you're drunk.

00:01:12.852 --> 00:01:14.767
(laughing)

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:15.600
- The sun.

00:01:16.973 --> 00:01:18.890
- I gotta pee so badly.

00:01:19.923 --> 00:01:20.756
- Say it.

00:01:20.756 --> 00:01:21.703
- The letter e, yeah!

00:01:21.703 --> 00:01:24.703
- Oh, I've heard this riddle before!

00:01:25.865 --> 00:01:27.015
- I've never heard of it.

00:01:27.015 --> 00:01:29.932
- How does it surround every place?

00:01:32.618 --> 00:01:34.201
- Fuck riddles man!

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:39.322
(swoosh)

00:01:39.322 --> 00:01:40.761
- Bitch, also infinity.

00:01:40.761 --> 00:01:42.845
- There should be quotations around this.

00:01:42.845 --> 00:01:44.226
- And that's why it's a fucking riddle.

00:01:44.226 --> 00:01:45.700
It's not here to be your friend.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.273
- It's an improper sentence.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:49.746
I'm a man of logic, not a man of nonsense.

00:01:49.746 --> 00:01:51.464
- Just 'cause I'm
smarter when I drink wine

00:01:51.464 --> 00:01:53.881
doesn't make me a bad person.

00:01:56.948 --> 00:01:58.615
- Riddle number two!

00:02:00.516 --> 00:02:02.599
(laughs)

00:02:06.529 --> 00:02:07.529
- Mouth.

00:02:07.529 --> 00:02:08.568
- I'm drunk.

00:02:08.568 --> 00:02:09.433
(laughs)

00:02:09.433 --> 00:02:10.281
- I know what it is!

00:02:10.281 --> 00:02:11.639
- Are you kidding me?

00:02:11.639 --> 00:02:12.597
(laughing)

00:02:12.597 --> 00:02:13.746
- Is it a river, or stream?

00:02:13.746 --> 00:02:15.371
- To me it feels like a garbage truck.

00:02:15.371 --> 00:02:17.507
The car is running, doesn't walk.

00:02:17.507 --> 00:02:18.923
- Why are you so good at riddles?

00:02:18.923 --> 00:02:20.415
- Dude I'm not good at a lot of

00:02:20.415 --> 00:02:22.475
