00:02:23.308 --> 00:02:25.424
(laughing)

00:02:25.424 --> 00:02:26.424
- What runs?

00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:30.508
- Diarrhea, your butt if you ate bad food.

00:02:30.508 --> 00:02:31.663
- Okay that's all diarrhea.

00:02:31.663 --> 00:02:32.496
- River bed!

00:02:32.496 --> 00:02:33.584
- A river!

00:02:33.584 --> 00:02:35.227
- We got that so fast we
don't have jokes about it.

00:02:35.227 --> 00:02:36.643
You wanna just make fun of Kate,

00:02:36.643 --> 00:02:38.181
'cause she's not figuring it out.

00:02:38.181 --> 00:02:40.300
- I murmur, I don't talk, but it's like.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.133
(grunting)

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.004
- [Both] The engine.

00:02:43.004 --> 00:02:44.252
- I have a bed, bed of a truck.

00:02:44.252 --> 00:02:45.622
I have a mouth, but I don't eat.

00:02:45.622 --> 00:02:47.404
- They close down, right.

00:02:47.404 --> 00:02:49.435
- Garbage truck.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.268
- Garbage truck.

00:02:50.268 --> 00:02:51.351
- What is it?

00:02:53.057 --> 00:02:54.943
- I'm right, fuck yeah!

00:02:54.943 --> 00:02:56.220
- You got that pretty quick.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.125
- We're crushing this.

00:02:57.125 --> 00:02:58.629
- I believe you got one wrong.

00:02:58.629 --> 00:03:00.225
I believe I'm crushing it.

00:03:00.225 --> 00:03:02.587
